WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:00.850
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:01.120 --> 01:06.280
Taming The Husband

3
01:06.400 --> 01:08.920
Episode 6

4
01:09.800 --> 01:11.120
Send out whoever's in charge.

5
01:11.280 --> 01:12.360
I'm here to buy back the jade.

6
01:12.440 --> 01:14.600
Three hundred taels. Not a wen more or less.

7
01:15.240 --> 01:17.680
Three hundred taels won't cover it.

8
01:20.080 --> 01:21.400
Half a month ago,

9
01:21.640 --> 01:22.960
your brother did bring in a jade carving

10
01:23.040 --> 01:24.720
to settle a debt of 300 taels.

11
01:25.120 --> 01:27.560
Then he went straight back to gambling.

12
01:27.960 --> 01:30.280
He lost, borrowed, and gambled again.

13
01:30.520 --> 01:31.520
Altogether,

14
01:31.920 --> 01:34.760
he borrowed 3,263 taels.

15
01:35.080 --> 01:36.400
At 30% interest a month,

16
01:36.560 --> 01:39.000
with interest up to today,

17
01:39.080 --> 01:40.480
you owe me

18
01:40.640 --> 01:42.880
3,720 taels.

19
01:44.280 --> 01:47.080
Thirty percent? Even loan sharks aren't that ruthless!

20
01:47.400 --> 01:49.760
Listen. Take the money and call it settled,

21
01:49.840 --> 01:51.480
or I'll go to the magistrate.

22
01:51.720 --> 01:54.200
The magistrate? You can't even read.

23
01:54.280 --> 01:55.960
How would you write a petition?

24
01:56.600 --> 01:58.720
Even if you paid someone to write it,

25
01:58.800 --> 01:59.960
going through the magistrate's office

26
02:00.040 --> 02:01.880
takes 10 days or two weeks, at best.

27
02:02.040 --> 02:03.960
Let me remind you, here,

28
02:04.040 --> 02:05.800
the interest adds up every day.

29
02:05.880 --> 02:07.000
Every extra day

30
02:07.080 --> 02:08.680
will cost you dozens of taels.

31
02:09.000 --> 02:10.800
And if you lose the case,

32
02:10.880 --> 02:13.880
that debt… You'd never pay it off.

33
02:15.520 --> 02:16.760
You know I can't read?

34
02:17.600 --> 02:18.760
You know who I am?

35
02:19.640 --> 02:20.640
Who told you?

36
02:20.840 --> 02:21.880
Two months ago,

37
02:22.200 --> 02:24.080
a scholar came to discuss marrying you.

38
02:24.600 --> 02:26.520
You tricked him into buying pork,

39
02:27.040 --> 02:29.600
then married into the wealthy Xie family.

40
02:29.840 --> 02:31.800
You made a fool of him.

41
02:32.160 --> 02:33.400
He's an honest man,

42
02:33.480 --> 02:35.200
so he won't make trouble for you.

43
02:35.560 --> 02:38.440
But I, his uncle,

44
02:38.520 --> 02:40.440
can't just let that pass.

45
02:41.080 --> 02:43.960
Today, if I get some satisfaction,

46
02:44.360 --> 02:46.280
perhaps I'll take pity on you

47
02:47.360 --> 02:48.960
and restore the jade to its owner.

48
02:49.040 --> 02:51.720
Restore what? Whatever you've got, bring it on!

49
02:51.800 --> 02:53.480
If you lose, you give me back the jade.

50
02:54.600 --> 02:56.680
Lady Jin, this is a gambling house.

51
02:56.760 --> 02:57.960
Gambling made my fortune.

52
02:58.040 --> 03:00.160
Why would I fight you?

53
03:01.000 --> 03:02.080
Play one game with me.

54
03:02.320 --> 03:03.680
If you win,

55
03:03.840 --> 03:08.160
your brother's debts are wiped out. Do you dare?

56
03:08.240 --> 03:09.720
-Play him! Play him! -Play him!

57
03:09.800 --> 03:10.960
-Play him! -Go on!

58
03:11.320 --> 03:14.800
Play him! Play him!

59
03:14.880 --> 03:17.560
No! Don't gamble! Don't!

60
03:17.640 --> 03:18.640
-Play! Play! -Baoyu!

61
03:18.720 --> 03:19.760
We'll play! We'll play!

62
03:19.840 --> 03:22.040
Baozhu, play him!

63
03:22.560 --> 03:24.200
Win this, and I'm set for life!

64
03:24.280 --> 03:25.560
-Baozhu! -Shut up!

65
03:25.920 --> 03:26.920
Nine out of ten gamblers lose!

66
03:27.120 --> 03:28.840
Keep barking, and I'll rip your mouth apart!

67
03:28.920 --> 03:30.800
He owes the money. I set the terms.

68
03:30.880 --> 03:33.600
Refuse, and the interest will keep compounding.

69
03:33.680 --> 03:35.080
You'd never clear the debt.

70
03:35.280 --> 03:37.360
Will you save him or watch him die?

71
03:37.560 --> 03:38.640
Your choice.

72
03:39.840 --> 03:43.240
I'm not gambling. I only want to buy my jade back.

73
03:43.480 --> 03:45.840
As for him, kill him, cut him up. I don't care.

74
03:46.040 --> 03:47.920
No! You can't kill him!

75
03:48.600 --> 03:49.960
You can't kill him!

76
03:50.440 --> 03:51.880
Baoyu started his lessons at six,

77
03:52.040 --> 03:53.440
learning to read and recite poetry.

78
03:53.680 --> 03:54.960
He worked so hard.

79
03:55.280 --> 03:58.000
Even when he was ill, he wouldn't neglect his studies.

80
03:58.080 --> 04:00.760
His teachers said he had a bright future.

81
04:02.240 --> 04:03.320
Your father died young.

82
04:03.880 --> 04:06.480
I worked day and night to raise you.

83
04:06.840 --> 04:08.480
Now you've married into wealth,

84
04:08.600 --> 04:10.160
you won't acknowledge your own mother!

85
04:11.520 --> 04:14.320
You… You can hit me, curse me,

86
04:14.400 --> 04:16.240
but please, have mercy.

87
04:16.960 --> 04:18.080
Save him.

88
04:18.320 --> 04:20.240
Save him! Please save him!

89
04:20.320 --> 04:22.720
I'm begging you! Save him!

90
04:23.680 --> 04:24.880
Please!

91
04:25.560 --> 04:27.120
I'm begging you!

92
04:27.280 --> 04:28.800
Then let everyone see

93
04:30.200 --> 04:33.200
whose hands have known nothing but luxury,

94
04:33.480 --> 04:35.280
and whose have worked day and night!

95
04:39.920 --> 04:42.720
Madam Huang, out of respect for your age,

96
04:42.960 --> 04:44.280
I call you Madam Huang.

97
04:45.120 --> 04:46.880
You didn't give birth to me.

98
04:47.080 --> 04:48.400
You certainly didn't raise me!

99
04:48.800 --> 04:49.880
If anyone doubts me,

100
04:49.960 --> 04:51.400
go and ask in the village

101
04:52.000 --> 04:53.600
whether there's a Jin family

102
04:53.800 --> 04:55.360
living entirely off one person!

103
04:56.000 --> 04:59.080
Isn't it enough that you bleed me dry every day?

104
04:59.880 --> 05:01.600
Even marriage hasn't given me any peace!

105
05:02.000 --> 05:03.320
And you have the nerve to blame me?

106
05:03.680 --> 05:05.880
Listen. My only mistake

107
05:06.120 --> 05:08.200
was keeping you all so fat and well fed,

108
05:08.280 --> 05:10.160
you've lost all sense of shame and all human decency!

109
05:10.760 --> 05:12.480
Your precious son promised me

110
05:12.960 --> 05:15.520
that if he gambled again, I'd chop off one of his hands.

111
05:15.880 --> 05:17.800
I merely broke his arm.

112
05:18.040 --> 05:19.480
He's lucky I haven't disowned him!

113
05:39.120 --> 05:40.200
Baoyu!

114
05:40.320 --> 05:41.320
Baoyu!

115
05:43.920 --> 05:46.920
Then… Then cut your ties.

116
05:47.680 --> 05:49.720
Jin Baozhu, if you win this game,

117
05:49.920 --> 05:51.880
the Jin family will have no claim on you.

118
05:52.520 --> 05:54.880
They'll never trouble you again.

119
05:56.400 --> 05:57.920
Do you accept?

120
06:00.680 --> 06:01.760
Baoyu!

121
06:06.600 --> 06:07.680
We're all human.

122
06:07.880 --> 06:10.960
Surely you have some compassion?

123
06:11.360 --> 06:13.960
Would you really watch your own brother

124
06:14.360 --> 06:16.000
die without lifting a finger?

125
06:16.440 --> 06:23.160
Play him! Play him!

126
06:23.240 --> 06:24.280
Baoyu!

127
06:24.800 --> 06:26.800
Don't gamble! Don't!

128
06:33.480 --> 06:34.560
I'll play him.

129
06:35.640 --> 06:38.000
Play him! Play him!

130
06:38.880 --> 06:41.360
Isn't that the Xie family's second young master?

131
06:41.440 --> 06:42.480
That's him.

132
06:59.120 --> 07:00.720
What a wind we're having today.

133
07:01.040 --> 07:02.440
It's blown Yangzhou's great scholar,

134
07:02.520 --> 07:04.240
Young Master Xie, right to my door.

135
07:04.360 --> 07:05.880
It's been a while, Master Qian.

136
07:06.840 --> 07:08.520
You haven't changed a bit.

137
07:08.840 --> 07:11.480
As petty and small-minded as ever.

138
07:11.760 --> 07:13.520
I used to come here often,

139
07:13.600 --> 07:14.720
and I never lost.

140
07:15.120 --> 07:16.840
You tried to challenge me several times,

141
07:16.920 --> 07:18.240
but I always turned you down.

142
07:19.960 --> 07:21.400
No time like the present.

143
07:21.680 --> 07:23.120
Since we're both here,

144
07:23.280 --> 07:25.320
let's settle our scores, old and new.

145
07:25.520 --> 07:27.000
Play a game with me.

146
07:27.600 --> 07:28.840
What do you say?

147
07:33.040 --> 07:35.680
Today's game is Ghost Tower.

148
07:36.040 --> 07:37.320
The rules are simple.

149
07:37.880 --> 07:39.920
We take 54 rectangular wooden blocks,

150
07:40.160 --> 07:42.320
stack them in alternating layers of three,

151
07:42.440 --> 07:44.880
and build an 18-story tower.

152
07:45.080 --> 07:47.400
We take turns removing blocks from it.

153
07:47.480 --> 07:49.680
Whoever brings it down loses.

154
07:49.960 --> 07:52.280
If half an incense stick burns down before you move, you lose.

155
07:52.360 --> 07:55.840
If you win, you take both the jade and your brother.

156
07:56.000 --> 07:59.720
If I win, you pay double Jin Baoyu's debt.

157
08:00.240 --> 08:01.440
Any objections?

158
08:03.440 --> 08:05.160
-None. -Good.

159
08:05.720 --> 08:07.600
Usually, in Ghost Tower,

160
08:07.680 --> 08:09.000
we pull out wooden blocks.

161
08:09.120 --> 08:10.440
Rather dull.

162
08:10.520 --> 08:12.800
Today, let's try something new.

163
08:18.760 --> 08:20.720
Treasure Bowl

164
08:22.120 --> 08:24.040
We'll use ice blocks

165
08:24.440 --> 08:26.600
instead of wood.

166
08:27.040 --> 08:28.800
We'll use a date spinner to decide who goes first.

167
08:28.880 --> 08:30.320
Red goes first, black goes second.

168
08:45.040 --> 08:46.080
Please.

169
09:16.520 --> 09:17.600
He's pulled out another one!

170
09:17.800 --> 09:19.400
Why does he take one, but you take two?

171
09:19.480 --> 09:24.400
Lady Jin, I never said you could take only one block per turn.

172
09:25.200 --> 09:26.760
In a gambling house,

173
09:26.840 --> 09:31.400
anything not expressly forbidden is allowed. Am I right?

174
09:31.520 --> 09:32.520
He's right!

175
09:32.880 --> 09:34.120
That's how it works.

176
09:34.360 --> 09:35.400
Exactly.

177
09:35.760 --> 09:36.760
That makes sense.

178
09:38.600 --> 09:40.720
Xi, how was that?

179
09:41.680 --> 09:44.000
Your big brother got revenge for you, didn't he?

180
09:44.440 --> 09:46.080
Your little brother was the clever one.

181
09:46.400 --> 09:48.440
He knew Qian Zhenshan was an old friend.

182
09:48.760 --> 09:50.200
Xie Heng is the only brother I have.

183
09:50.600 --> 09:52.120
Another word, and I'll pull your tongue out!

184
10:10.280 --> 10:11.280
Brilliant! Brilliant!

185
10:11.400 --> 10:12.720
Amazing! So steady!

186
10:16.200 --> 10:17.240
Your turn.

187
10:35.200 --> 10:36.200
Good! Good!

188
10:36.360 --> 10:37.480
Brilliant! Brilliant!

189
10:51.520 --> 10:53.720
Wait. Salt melts ice.

190
10:54.000 --> 10:55.280
You just picked up some salt.

191
10:56.120 --> 10:57.800
When you remove an ice block,

192
10:58.440 --> 11:00.440
you could rub salt on the joints.

193
11:00.920 --> 11:02.000
By my turn,

194
11:02.360 --> 11:03.800
the tower would have melted and collapsed.

195
11:04.240 --> 11:05.600
How could I prove my innocence?

196
11:10.080 --> 11:11.160
Master Qian, isn't that cheating?

197
11:11.280 --> 11:12.640
You're playing dirty, Master Qian!

198
11:13.480 --> 11:15.160
It's only a few grains of salt.

199
11:16.760 --> 11:17.800
I'll wipe them off.

200
11:31.600 --> 11:32.680
Fine.

201
11:34.080 --> 11:35.920
Brilliant! Brilliant! Amazing!

202
11:36.640 --> 11:37.720
Your turn.

203
11:38.920 --> 11:40.240
He's in trouble now.

204
11:54.520 --> 11:55.640
Make a fuss, if you like.

205
11:55.720 --> 11:58.680
If that tower falls, your husband is finished.

206
12:00.200 --> 12:01.920
Anything not expressly forbidden is allowed.

207
12:02.080 --> 12:04.000
If I expose them now,

208
12:04.240 --> 12:05.920
they might not even be disqualified,

209
12:06.160 --> 12:07.240
and I could startle Xie Yan.

210
12:17.120 --> 12:18.160
This is bad.

211
12:31.160 --> 12:32.920
Half the incense stick is almost gone.

212
12:33.280 --> 12:36.080
Young Master Xie, if you don't make your move,

213
12:36.360 --> 12:39.040
the tower will melt by itself.

214
12:39.520 --> 12:40.560
Pull one out!

215
12:40.680 --> 12:42.160
Go on! Hurry up and pull one!

216
12:42.240 --> 12:43.440
Pull one, Young Master Xie!

217
12:43.720 --> 12:44.800
What are you waiting for?

218
12:45.560 --> 12:47.600
Hurry up! What's taking so long?

219
12:56.640 --> 12:57.720
Brilliant!

220
12:58.920 --> 13:00.480
Good! Good!

221
13:00.600 --> 13:01.760
Amazing! Absolutely amazing!

222
13:01.840 --> 13:04.320
Master Qian, I'm out of moves.

223
13:05.320 --> 13:06.560
Please, go on.

224
13:46.360 --> 13:47.800
He's sure to win now!

225
13:47.880 --> 13:49.160
Master Qian's the best!

226
13:57.840 --> 13:59.040
It fell after all!

227
14:00.440 --> 14:02.600
So close! Master Qian lost!

228
14:05.040 --> 14:06.080
We won!

229
14:08.160 --> 14:09.160
Xi.

230
14:10.400 --> 14:11.560
Well played.

231
14:14.680 --> 14:15.720
Wait!

232
14:16.840 --> 14:18.120
Young Master Xie,

233
14:18.560 --> 14:20.360
you were supposed

234
14:20.480 --> 14:22.280
to take three turns in all.

235
14:22.680 --> 14:24.080
But this tray

236
14:24.280 --> 14:25.720
has only two ice blocks.

237
14:25.800 --> 14:27.320
That means on your last turn,

238
14:27.800 --> 14:29.080
you didn't take one at all!

239
14:29.760 --> 14:31.480
I made the rules quite clear.

240
14:31.680 --> 14:33.200
We were to take turns

241
14:33.280 --> 14:34.480
removing blocks from the ice tower.

242
14:34.800 --> 14:36.560
You cheated.

243
14:37.000 --> 14:39.760
This game doesn't count!

244
14:41.880 --> 14:43.480
He's right! He's right!

245
14:43.760 --> 14:45.080
From start to finish,

246
14:45.680 --> 14:48.680
I only took two turns. Didn't I?

247
14:56.520 --> 14:58.760
It isn't that I failed to take a block on my turn.

248
14:59.280 --> 15:01.320
Your turn was taking so long,

249
15:01.560 --> 15:02.960
I grew impatient

250
15:03.320 --> 15:06.480
and took a block to play with while I waited.

251
15:07.640 --> 15:10.480
Is that not allowed? You said it yourself,

252
15:10.920 --> 15:14.400
"Anything not expressly forbidden is allowed."

253
15:14.640 --> 15:16.120
Yes, that's true.

254
15:16.640 --> 15:18.000
Master Qian said so himself.

255
15:18.880 --> 15:21.560
Besides, I told you quite plainly,

256
15:22.080 --> 15:24.160
"I'm out of moves. Please, go on."

257
15:24.920 --> 15:26.280
And you agreed, didn't you?

258
15:27.080 --> 15:28.160
Impossible!

259
15:29.000 --> 15:30.520
How could I lose to you?

260
15:31.000 --> 15:32.480
To a cripple,

261
15:32.960 --> 15:35.320
a sick wretch with one foot in the grave!

262
15:35.400 --> 15:36.480
-Shut your mouth! -You--

263
15:37.200 --> 15:38.320
My husband, Xie Yan,

264
15:38.400 --> 15:40.200
is Yangzhou's renowned scholar!

265
15:40.360 --> 15:42.000
He came first in all three exams!

266
15:42.080 --> 15:43.400
Who are you to insult him?

267
15:57.320 --> 15:58.520
Baozhu, let's go.

268
16:01.840 --> 16:03.280
Where did you learn to be so smooth?

269
16:03.920 --> 16:05.520
-You know? -Of course I know.

270
16:05.680 --> 16:06.720
How did you know?

271
16:07.040 --> 16:08.040
I'm clever, aren't I?

272
16:20.760 --> 16:22.880
Madam hasn't been feeling well.

273
16:23.360 --> 16:24.840
She's already gone to bed.

274
16:25.240 --> 16:27.040
I've brought some tonic herbs.

275
16:27.440 --> 16:28.720
Make sure you brew them for her.

276
16:29.000 --> 16:30.080
Yes, sir.

277
16:58.240 --> 17:00.800
Madam seems very fond of this kite.

278
17:00.880 --> 17:02.520
It's too worn to mend,

279
17:03.080 --> 17:04.960
but she insists on keeping it up.

280
17:06.160 --> 17:09.040
I hear Wanjun has found Yan a bride.

281
17:09.800 --> 17:11.240
What's the girl like?

282
17:11.600 --> 17:13.080
It's not my place to say, sir.

283
17:19.280 --> 17:21.040
If she's won Yan's favor,

284
17:21.560 --> 17:24.040
she must be very understanding,

285
17:24.520 --> 17:25.600
gentle and clever.

286
17:41.400 --> 17:43.280
Lady Qin! The master's back!

287
17:43.600 --> 17:45.800
Lady Qin! The master's back!

288
17:48.320 --> 17:49.720
Chengzong!

289
17:51.640 --> 17:53.200
You're finally home!

290
17:54.920 --> 17:56.880
I've been longing for your return.

291
17:59.120 --> 18:01.360
Let me look at you. You've lost weight.

292
18:01.440 --> 18:02.520
Father,

293
18:05.560 --> 18:07.200
your son's still here, you know.

294
18:08.720 --> 18:10.040
What has you so pleased?

295
18:10.120 --> 18:11.120
I've missed you day and night,

296
18:11.200 --> 18:12.440
praying for your safety.

297
18:12.560 --> 18:14.160
Now you're safely home at last,

298
18:15.040 --> 18:16.320
of course I'm happy.

299
18:16.680 --> 18:18.680
You've traveled so far, Father. You must be exhausted.

300
18:20.240 --> 18:22.960
While I've been away, you've grown taller again.

301
18:24.840 --> 18:26.360
Your coming-of-age ceremony is next year, isn't it?

302
18:26.440 --> 18:29.520
Yes. I now oversee grain transport at the docks.

303
18:29.600 --> 18:31.240
Soon I'll be ready to set sail,

304
18:31.320 --> 18:32.400
just like you, Father,

305
18:32.520 --> 18:33.880
out on the open river.

306
18:34.640 --> 18:36.240
Good lad. You'll go far.

307
18:37.680 --> 18:40.200
Where's your sister? Off running wild again?

308
18:40.280 --> 18:42.080
Xi knew you'd be home today,

309
18:42.160 --> 18:43.560
so she went into town early

310
18:43.640 --> 18:45.600
to buy you a New Year gift.

311
18:49.280 --> 18:50.880
Come and have a look!

312
18:51.040 --> 18:52.600
Don't like it? You don't pay!

313
18:52.680 --> 18:55.040
Sir! Four bowls of the free stuff, then!

314
18:55.840 --> 18:57.320
Buy more, get more free!

315
18:57.400 --> 18:58.920
Then give me more free

316
18:59.000 --> 19:00.280
until I owe you nothing!

317
19:01.120 --> 19:03.080
Four bowls of noodles. She's paying.

318
19:04.600 --> 19:05.680
Coming up!

319
19:10.320 --> 19:11.960
Here are your noodles!

320
19:13.880 --> 19:15.080
Your noodles.

321
19:18.320 --> 19:20.120
-Your noodles. -Thank you.

322
19:23.240 --> 19:24.280
Eat up.

323
19:29.560 --> 19:31.920
Sir! Two extra scoops of meat topping for him.

324
19:32.000 --> 19:33.080
Coming up!

325
19:35.080 --> 19:36.400
That's far too plain.

326
19:37.760 --> 19:40.000
Your meat topping.

327
19:48.560 --> 19:50.080
Do they get their oil for free?

328
19:50.160 --> 19:51.760
Too greasy? Add some vinegar.

329
19:51.920 --> 19:54.720
Besides, it's the oil that makes it so good.

330
19:54.800 --> 19:56.360
Everyone who's had it agrees.

331
20:02.040 --> 20:03.240
Who did you eat here with?

332
20:11.120 --> 20:12.760
Eat. Go on, eat, eat!

333
20:17.280 --> 20:18.840
The one who helped you leave the estate?

334
20:21.360 --> 20:22.760
You… could say that.

335
20:22.840 --> 20:23.920
A man or a woman?

336
20:24.480 --> 20:25.560
A man.

337
20:31.240 --> 20:32.560
Too much vinegar. Add some noodles.

338
20:32.880 --> 20:33.960
Yes, yes. Some more.

339
20:39.320 --> 20:41.360
Why don't we have New Year couplets

340
20:41.440 --> 20:42.440
and lanterns in our courtyard?

341
20:42.880 --> 20:45.440
I saw the other courtyards all have them.

342
20:45.520 --> 20:47.480
They're so colorful and pretty.

343
20:49.040 --> 20:50.440
Why are you ignoring me?

344
20:53.000 --> 20:56.440
I'm wondering about the man you bought noodles for.

345
20:56.840 --> 20:58.480
Did you give him extra meat, too?

346
21:10.720 --> 21:12.640
I did. Besides,

347
21:12.720 --> 21:13.920
I earned that money myself.

348
21:14.280 --> 21:15.440
Why shouldn't I?

349
21:17.160 --> 21:18.160
You miser.

350
21:20.240 --> 21:22.280
I might as well be talking to a wall.

351
21:22.360 --> 21:24.880
Such fine words, wasted on you.

352
21:25.560 --> 21:27.480
What does that mean? I don't understand.

353
21:28.040 --> 21:29.280
Why are you smiling if you don't get it?

354
21:38.480 --> 21:41.480
Eat your noodles. We have something important to discuss.

355
21:42.000 --> 21:43.880
Something important? What is it?

356
21:44.200 --> 21:46.080
The Xie estate

357
21:47.240 --> 21:49.400
Next, I shall perform

358
21:49.480 --> 21:50.880
Three Immortals Return.

359
21:51.240 --> 21:53.200
The three red balls in this trick

360
21:53.280 --> 21:57.160
are Fortune, Prosperity, and Longevity.

361
21:57.480 --> 21:59.640
These two bowls are their caves.

362
22:00.040 --> 22:03.120
Mother, this is Three Immortals Return.

363
22:03.360 --> 22:04.960
Two bowls, three balls.

364
22:05.280 --> 22:06.560
They keep changing places.

365
22:07.040 --> 22:08.560
Until you lift the bowls,

366
22:08.640 --> 22:10.440
you never know where the balls are.

367
22:12.560 --> 22:13.640
Watch.

368
22:14.040 --> 22:15.160
This ball is here.

369
22:15.800 --> 22:16.800
This one goes here.

370
22:16.880 --> 22:18.440
And this one goes in my palm.

371
22:18.520 --> 22:21.480
With the word "In!" Look.

372
22:22.920 --> 22:23.960
Wonderful!

373
22:24.880 --> 22:26.920
And now, "Across!"

374
22:28.680 --> 22:30.040
Look again.

375
22:32.440 --> 22:33.800
Good! Good!

376
22:33.880 --> 22:34.960
Wonderful!

377
22:35.400 --> 22:36.640
Go and collect your reward.

378
22:36.720 --> 22:37.800
Thank you, Madam!

379
22:37.960 --> 22:39.560
How thoughtful of you, Brother.

380
22:41.680 --> 22:43.480
It's New Year's Eve.

381
22:43.880 --> 22:46.680
Come, raise your cups.

382
22:46.800 --> 22:48.440
Let's drink together.

383
22:48.880 --> 22:50.320
Mother, to your long life! To your long life!

384
22:50.480 --> 22:52.360
Mother, to your long life!

385
22:52.480 --> 22:53.800
Happy New Year!

386
22:53.880 --> 22:55.240
-Happy New Year! -Happy New Year!

387
22:55.400 --> 22:56.480
All the best! Come, drink.

388
22:57.400 --> 23:01.760
Grandmother, I must ask your forgiveness.

389
23:06.960 --> 23:08.400
On New Year's Eve?

390
23:08.720 --> 23:10.280
Whatever for?

391
23:10.680 --> 23:12.040
What have you done?

392
23:12.880 --> 23:14.440
Some valuables were stolen from my courtyard.

393
23:14.800 --> 23:16.120
Luckily, I discovered it in time

394
23:16.200 --> 23:17.200
and recovered them.

395
23:17.560 --> 23:18.920
The thief has repented

396
23:19.000 --> 23:20.160
and sworn never to do it again.

397
23:20.680 --> 23:22.000
But I failed to keep my servants in line

398
23:22.080 --> 23:23.240
and stop this before it happened.

399
23:24.200 --> 23:25.320
Please punish me, Grandmother.

400
23:26.080 --> 23:28.200
You're too kind for your own good.

401
23:28.880 --> 23:30.160
Who dared do such a thing?

402
23:30.720 --> 23:32.800
Your father's here to back you up. Throw them out!

403
23:33.960 --> 23:34.960
Don't be afraid.

404
23:40.440 --> 23:43.280
Grandmother, if I may, I'd like to ask you to forgive Yan.

405
23:44.080 --> 23:45.400
Family property was stolen,

406
23:45.480 --> 23:46.800
and Yan was at fault.

407
23:47.280 --> 23:48.280
But the thief

408
23:48.400 --> 23:50.240
even cut off a finger to swear an oath.

409
23:50.680 --> 23:53.200
Clearly, there's more to this story.

410
23:54.040 --> 23:55.280
Now the property's been returned,

411
23:55.800 --> 23:58.160
and Yan has told you the truth.

412
23:58.280 --> 24:00.680
Please forgive him, Grandmother.

413
24:02.160 --> 24:04.760
Our bodies are our parents' gift to us.

414
24:05.520 --> 24:07.360
How can we so lightly mutilate them?

415
24:08.080 --> 24:09.880
Our family rules may be strict,

416
24:10.280 --> 24:13.040
but we aren't a family of unreasonable brutes.

417
24:14.080 --> 24:16.520
If an outsider steals from us,

418
24:16.600 --> 24:18.040
they face the magistrate,

419
24:18.200 --> 24:20.680
and take their beating.

420
24:21.280 --> 24:24.720
How did things come to this? Sit down.

421
24:27.400 --> 24:29.800
We wanted to report it, but we couldn't.

422
24:31.880 --> 24:34.280
The man who cut off his finger is my brother.

423
24:35.520 --> 24:36.680
I come from humble origins.

424
24:37.040 --> 24:38.760
I know I've married above my station.

425
24:38.960 --> 24:40.560
They say marrying up is like swallowing needles.

426
24:40.920 --> 24:42.560
If people found out,

427
24:42.720 --> 24:44.280
they'd look down on me even more.

428
24:44.400 --> 24:45.800
You simply didn't dare!

429
24:45.880 --> 24:47.400
And you use our family as an excuse?

430
24:47.680 --> 24:49.400
"Marrying up is like swallowing needles"?

431
24:49.600 --> 24:51.080
When have we ever made you do that?

432
24:51.600 --> 24:54.400
My place in this household,

433
24:54.600 --> 24:56.080
and how people treat me,

434
24:56.240 --> 24:58.480
Madam, you know only too well.

435
24:59.080 --> 25:01.000
I admit I had selfish reasons. That's one of them.

436
25:01.320 --> 25:02.880
But there's our family's reputation, too.

437
25:03.240 --> 25:04.440
He's my brother,

438
25:04.520 --> 25:06.720
which makes him a close relative of the Xies by marriage.

439
25:06.800 --> 25:10.160
Had we gone to the magistrate, imagine what people would have said!

440
25:10.720 --> 25:13.560
So we couldn't let word get out.

441
25:13.800 --> 25:15.120
But we couldn't let him off, either.

442
25:17.640 --> 25:18.800
Get up.

443
25:19.720 --> 25:22.160
I'm glad you considered our family's name.

444
25:22.840 --> 25:25.480
Still, the two of you kept this from us.

445
25:25.640 --> 25:26.960
You deserve punishment for that.

446
25:27.600 --> 25:29.320
Do you accept it?

447
25:29.400 --> 25:30.480
-Yes! -Yes, I do!

448
25:30.600 --> 25:31.680
I don't!

449
25:33.040 --> 25:34.080
Xi!

450
25:34.200 --> 25:36.680
Grandmother, don't let them fool you!

451
25:36.800 --> 25:38.800
They were in such a hurry to confess

452
25:38.920 --> 25:41.480
because they went to a gambling house to recover the valuables!

453
25:42.280 --> 25:44.240
They were afraid it would get out and cause a scandal.

454
25:44.440 --> 25:45.560
That's why they're doing this!

455
25:45.880 --> 25:48.040
If they cared about the family's good name,

456
25:48.120 --> 25:50.600
why show their faces at a gambling house?

457
25:51.160 --> 25:52.880
Did Xie Xi go there herself,

458
25:53.040 --> 25:54.920
to speak with such certainty?

459
25:55.280 --> 25:56.680
I… I didn't.

460
25:57.680 --> 25:59.880
Lu Ziyu told me!

461
26:01.280 --> 26:02.600
That explains it.

462
26:03.320 --> 26:06.160
Grandmother, I went to the Lu estate to collect a debt.

463
26:06.280 --> 26:07.640
He got quite a beating because of it.

464
26:07.880 --> 26:09.000
He resents me,

465
26:09.440 --> 26:10.720
so naturally he'd exaggerate.

466
26:11.280 --> 26:13.280
That's not true! You--

467
26:13.560 --> 26:15.640
Grandmother, I'm not lying!

468
26:15.720 --> 26:16.960
Everything I said is true!

469
26:17.280 --> 26:18.280
If you don't believe me,

470
26:18.680 --> 26:20.240
I'll go and fetch Lu Ziyu right now!

471
26:20.320 --> 26:22.280
Enough! Stop this nonsense. Sit down.

472
26:23.280 --> 26:24.520
That's enough. Listen to your father.

473
26:24.600 --> 26:26.520
Sit down and eat.

474
26:28.680 --> 26:29.880
Listen to your father.

475
26:30.280 --> 26:33.720
Exactly. What matters most is having the whole family

476
26:33.800 --> 26:35.800
together for a meal. Don't be angry.

477
26:35.880 --> 26:37.880
She's right, Brother.

478
26:38.120 --> 26:39.360
Don't be upset.

479
26:39.800 --> 26:42.160
Children are bound to be foolish.

480
26:42.400 --> 26:45.080
Xi, be good. Have some more.

481
26:45.680 --> 26:48.400
Learning from mistakes is what matters.

482
26:53.480 --> 26:54.560
Let's all eat.

483
26:55.360 --> 26:56.480
Let's eat.

484
26:56.600 --> 26:57.600
Eat up.

485
26:59.120 --> 27:01.320
-Have some food. -Here. Don't cry.

486
27:01.680 --> 27:04.560
I… I did nothing wrong!

487
27:05.080 --> 27:07.120
Why do you all blame me?

488
27:07.200 --> 27:09.080
-Here. -It's not my fault!

489
27:09.160 --> 27:11.080
It's not my fault!

490
27:16.160 --> 27:17.560
It's New Year's Eve.

491
27:17.640 --> 27:19.640
Must you make a scene?

492
27:20.760 --> 27:22.080
You wanted to fetch someone, didn't you?

493
27:22.160 --> 27:23.160
Go on, then.

494
27:23.880 --> 27:24.960
I…

495
27:34.680 --> 27:35.880
Say just that at the table later.

496
27:36.120 --> 27:38.720
We have to get in first. Understand?

497
27:38.880 --> 27:40.160
What if they won't let it go

498
27:40.240 --> 27:41.480
and keep coming after us?

499
27:41.640 --> 27:43.400
No one wants a scandal at dinner.

500
27:43.480 --> 27:46.080
Most people would rather play it down and let the matter drop.

501
27:46.840 --> 27:48.880
Even a pig needs tying in three places.

502
27:48.960 --> 27:50.520
We've made such a mess,

503
27:50.600 --> 27:51.800
and that's your only plan?

504
27:51.880 --> 27:53.680
Why would the second branch object?

505
27:54.080 --> 27:56.840
Unless someone's as stupid as a pig.

506
27:57.880 --> 27:59.480
I swear to Heaven,

507
28:00.080 --> 28:02.360
every word Miss Xi said is true.

508
28:02.720 --> 28:04.360
I told her what happened.

509
28:04.440 --> 28:06.320
She's never set foot in that place.

510
28:11.320 --> 28:12.400
Heaven sees all.

511
28:12.480 --> 28:13.480
Wrongdoing never goes unpunished.

512
28:14.080 --> 28:15.680
You'd do well to tell the truth.

513
28:15.960 --> 28:17.880
What good is swearing?

514
28:18.320 --> 28:19.440
If Heaven had eyes,

515
28:19.520 --> 28:21.720
why would a lovesick lapdog

516
28:21.800 --> 28:23.120
get nothing for all his devotion?

517
28:23.400 --> 28:24.480
You--

518
28:24.720 --> 28:25.960
Baozhu speaks her mind.

519
28:26.040 --> 28:27.080
Please forgive her.

520
28:28.280 --> 28:29.280
She may be rash,

521
28:31.360 --> 28:33.040
but she's right about one thing.

522
28:33.280 --> 28:35.880
An oath may ease the conscience,

523
28:36.360 --> 28:37.480
but proves nothing.

524
28:37.920 --> 28:39.880
Are you calling me a liar?

525
28:39.960 --> 28:40.960
My father is a Grand Master for Governance,

526
28:41.040 --> 28:42.640
Yangzhou's deputy prefect for river affairs.

527
28:42.720 --> 28:43.800
Why would I lie?

528
28:43.880 --> 28:46.400
Calm yourself, Master Lu.

529
28:46.760 --> 28:50.080
I have a way to discover the truth.

530
28:51.200 --> 28:52.240
Servant!

531
28:58.280 --> 28:59.360
What's this?

532
28:59.480 --> 29:01.160
I once captured a magical snake.

533
29:01.920 --> 29:03.280
Reach in and touch it.

534
29:03.840 --> 29:05.040
If you're lying,

535
29:05.680 --> 29:07.160
it will bite you to death.

536
29:07.760 --> 29:11.360
If not, you'll be unharmed. Do you dare?

537
29:13.960 --> 29:15.400
But why am I asking?

538
29:15.680 --> 29:17.080
The son of a Grand Master for Governance,

539
29:17.160 --> 29:19.280
Yangzhou's deputy prefect for river affairs,

540
29:19.960 --> 29:21.600
could hardly be afraid.

541
29:22.040 --> 29:23.080
Could he?

542
29:34.520 --> 29:35.640
How could Yan do this?

543
29:35.720 --> 29:37.160
He's playing with a man's life!

544
29:37.720 --> 29:39.760
And Grandmother won't even stop him!

545
29:40.480 --> 29:41.560
Go to my room, quickly.

546
29:41.640 --> 29:44.400
There's some sulfur by my bed.

547
29:44.600 --> 29:45.680
Mix it with water

548
29:45.760 --> 29:47.000
and offer to wash his hands.

549
29:47.080 --> 29:48.120
Yes! Yes!

550
29:51.760 --> 29:53.240
If magical snakes existed,

551
29:53.400 --> 29:55.080
why would we need bailiffs and jailers?

552
29:55.520 --> 29:57.160
That jar has nothing in it

553
29:57.240 --> 29:59.240
but a defanged snake and mugwort.

554
29:59.440 --> 30:01.440
When mugwort meets sulfur, it turns red.

555
30:02.040 --> 30:03.320
Have him wash his hands,

556
30:03.480 --> 30:04.880
and you'll only give the game away.

557
30:06.240 --> 30:07.600
Sit quietly and wait.

558
30:30.160 --> 30:32.080
See? It didn't bite.

559
30:32.680 --> 30:33.800
It didn't bite me!

560
30:33.920 --> 30:36.400
I told the truth!

561
30:36.720 --> 30:39.200
Master Lu, did you really touch the magical snake?

562
30:40.040 --> 30:41.240
I certainly did!

563
30:42.000 --> 30:43.040
Jianwei.

564
30:43.520 --> 30:44.560
Yes, my lord.

565
30:50.560 --> 30:51.960
But the jar's empty.

566
30:52.760 --> 30:54.240
Where's this magical snake?

567
30:58.640 --> 30:59.720
Master Lu,

568
31:01.280 --> 31:02.720
on New Year's Eve, too.

569
31:03.440 --> 31:04.920
Thank you for coming all this way.

570
31:05.680 --> 31:07.000
As for today's events,

571
31:08.080 --> 31:10.160
please keep them to yourself.

572
31:11.280 --> 31:12.600
-Matron Fang. -Yes, Madam.

573
31:12.680 --> 31:13.720
Show our guest out.

574
31:13.840 --> 31:16.120
Someone! Take the jar away.

575
31:28.680 --> 31:29.720
Xie Xi!

576
31:31.280 --> 31:32.840
Satisfied now?

577
31:42.160 --> 31:43.800
Grandmother, I…

578
31:43.880 --> 31:45.800
Making a spectacle of us before outsiders!

579
31:45.880 --> 31:47.600
Are you all satisfied now?

580
31:49.080 --> 31:50.080
You're in charge here.

581
31:50.800 --> 31:52.480
Look at your daughter.

582
31:53.280 --> 31:56.000
Well? How should she be punished?
